/* Private names for the third-party code compiled into the application library. Default libraries link statically
 * into one runtime executable, so every external symbol of the vendored C libraries (zlib, libspng, giflib, libtiff,
 * Brotli, utf8proc) is renamed with the prefix aqua_application_: another library vendoring the same code never
 * clashes with this copy. The build force-includes this header into the vendored sources and the library's own.
 *
 * The list is the set of external symbols the pinned versions define (llvm-nm --defined-only --extern-only on the
 * compiled third-party objects). After changing a pin, rebuild and check that no unprefixed third-party symbol is
 * left, e.g. llvm-nm --defined-only --extern-only libaqua_application.a | grep -v "aqua_application_\|aqua_library_",
 * and add any new ones here.
 */
